@title Preferences > Cross references: how they show on screen and how strongly they fade (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# The choices live in Preferences > Cross references: "Cross references on screen" (Full, Fade where they overlap, Faded, Hidden) and "How strongly they fade" (Light, Medium, Strong). The same choices are on Shift+X and View > Cross references.
open qa/fixtures/references-overlap.kopercad
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 10
text preferences
wait 10
key Enter
wait 30
shot preferences
scroll 680 400 -700
wait 20
shot preferences-cross-references
check_layout
